# Onboarding

Welcome! This page uses **bold**, _italic_, ~~strike~~, `code`, ==highlight== and a [link](https://example.com).

## Checklist

- [x] Laptop
- [ ] Accounts

  - [ ] VPN
  - [ ] Wiki

1. Read the handbook
2. Meet the team

   - Engineering
   - Product

| Tool | Purpose | Owner |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Wiki | docs | Ops |
| Chat | talk \| ask | IT |

> [!WARNING]
> Never share your password.

> A plain quote over two lines.

```rust
fn main() {
    println!("hi");
}
```

